# Keep secrets, local state and bulky/dev-only files out of the image.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.git/
.gitignore
db.sqlite3
staticfiles/
node_modules/
docs/
googleform-ss/
*.docx
CLAUDE.md
.claude/

# Uploaded media ships with the image so the demo data the database rows point
# at is actually present in the container. Last match wins in .dockerignore, so
# this stays after the patterns above and keeps media/ in no matter what they
# would otherwise catch (media/docs/*.docx vs the *.docx rule, say).
!media/**
